WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 7.6 · Brand, Identity & Image
Brand guidelines

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Short, practical guidelines let others apply your brand without asking you.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Keep the guide to two to four pages.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Store templates in one place with an owner.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Set rules for partner and funder logos.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Tide Line: a one-page guide in Bahasa Indonesia, pinned in the WhatsApp group, with photo rules for children.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your guidelines outline, templates list and co-branding rules.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
